Description: script-friendly SMTP command-line mailer
 Postout is a Linux command-line mailer for scripts, monitoring jobs,
 administrators, and interactive use.
 .
 It supports personal and shared system SMTP profiles, authenticated
 and unauthenticated relays, plain-text and HTML messages, attachments,
 and To, Cc, and Bcc recipients.
